## When making code changes

1. Read relevant sections of `.first-plan/` before proposing changes
2. Follow existing conventions strictly
3. Reuse existing utilities before creating new
4. Consider quality state (coverage, flaky tests) when refactoring
5. Do not break API contracts
6. Never suggest deprecated patterns
7. Consider runtime state (released vs unreleased) when planning fixes

